    "author_association": "NONE",
    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [X] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\n- [X] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n\n### Module(s)\n\nmini.indentscope\n\n### Description\n\nHello Guys.\r\n\r\ni love your plugin mini.indentscope, but when i open neovim it would show the indentline in my dashboard.\r\n\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/112868514/204803871-350764f3-eca2-424b-b487-0807df3a81cc.png)\r\n\r\nIt would be really nice to add a config parameter to exclude files. I suggest filetype_exclude as in \"lukas-reineke/indent-blankline.nvim\".\r\n\r\nthank you in advance\r\nbest regards",
